        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Color guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue = core company entity; yellow = company repeating/detail records; green = financial data; red = ownership links; purple = family-tree response snapshot.&lt;br&gt;Colors are visual grouping only; they do not indicate relationship strength or mandatory/optional participation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Model note:&lt;/b&gt; Proposed normalized design from the sample JSON. Current pipeline outputs a flat enriched Parquet table. DUNS should be stored as text." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=18;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="1210" width="650" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
